#. type: Title #
#: docs/guide/database.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "PostgreSQL Setup and Operations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> FreeAnima uses PostgreSQL for conversation archives, semantic memory, self layer, and related data.\n"
"> Related concepts: [`memory.md`](../concepts/memory.md), [`sleep.md`](../concepts/sleep.md).\n"
"> Security and credentials: [`security.md`](security.md).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connection Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:14
msgid "Set the database URL in `config.yaml`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/database.md:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"database:\n"
"  url: postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/anima\n"
"  # or use env() (bootstrap cannot resolve vault() — Vault lives in PG):\n"
"  # url: env(\"DATABASE_URL\")\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:23
msgid ""
"Production **must** set `database.url`. Prefer `env(\"DATABASE_URL\")` over "
"plaintext passwords in `config.yaml` (Vault is unavailable at cold start). "
"Path conventions: [`security.md`](security.md#credential-responsibilities)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:25
msgid ""
"Optional pool overrides（见 [`src/core/db/pg/client.ts`](../../src/core/db/"
"pg/client.ts)）:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Env                              | Default | Notes                                                                     |\n"
"| -------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `FREEANIMA_PG_POOL_MAX`          | `10`    | 连接池上限，对齐部署 `max_connections`                                    |\n"
"| `FREEANIMA_PG_POOL_IDLE_TIMEOUT` | `0`     | 秒；`0` = 关闭。Bun ≤1.3.14 勿设 `30`（会误杀长查询，见 troubleshooting） |\n"
"| `FREEANIMA_PG_POOL_MAX_LIFETIME` | `0`     | 秒；`0` = 不限制连接寿命                                                  |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Local Install (Debian)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/database.md:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Install PostgreSQL, create anima db/user (requires sudo)\n"
"sudo ./scripts/setup-postgres-debian.sh\n"
"\n"
"# config.yaml (example):\n"
"#   url: env(\"DATABASE_URL\")\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:43
msgid ""
"Defaults: PostgreSQL 17, `localhost` only, `scram-sha-256`, dedicated "
"`anima` database and user."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extensions (One-Time)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:47
msgid ""
"Full-text and vector search require PostgreSQL extensions. The app user "
"usually cannot `CREATE EXTENSION`; run as superuser:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/database.md:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo apt install postgresql-17-pgvector   # match psql --version\n"
"sudo -u postgres psql -d anima -f core/scripts/ensure-pg-extensions.sql\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:54
msgid ""
"Fresh Debian installs via `setup-postgres-debian.sh` handle extensions "
"automatically."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schema Migrations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:59
msgid ""
"**Production (recommended):** When PostgreSQL is configured, `anima service` "
"**auto-applies** pending schema migrations on startup."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:59
msgid "**Manual:**"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/database.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"DATABASE_URL=\"postgresql://anima:…@127.0.0.1:5432/anima\" \\\n"
"  just db migrate\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:66
msgid "Run after extensions are installed, or restart `anima service`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "`auto_llm_runs` (audit)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:70
msgid ""
"Background LLM without user turns (cron agent, sleep pipeline stages) writes "
"to `auto_llm_runs` instead of creating `conversations`. Retention (optional "
"`config.yaml`):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/database.md:71
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"auto_llm:\n"
"  retention_days: 30\n"
"  per_run_kind_keep: 100\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:78
msgid ""
"Purged during sleep-cycle step `conversation-cleanup` (after stale "
"conversation cleanup). Cron script runs (`no_agent`) use `cron_log` only."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backups"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:85
msgid ""
"**Migrations do not replace backups** — schedule regular full backups (e.g. "
"`pg_dump`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:85
msgid "Back up before destructive changes."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:85
msgid ""
"Include `~/.anima/` (`FREEANIMA_HOME` overridable) in backup policy — see "
"[`security.md`](security.md#data-persistence)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:85
msgid ""
"Recommended local stack: hourly `pg_dump` + home tar (short retention), WAL "
"archive (`archive_mode`), weekly `pg_basebackup` for PITR. Restore logical "
"dumps as postgres superuser (`pg_restore --no-owner --no-acl --no-comments`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "Integration Tests (Developers)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:89
msgid ""
"Full integration tests require **Docker** for a temporary PostgreSQL "
"instance:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/database.md:90
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"just qa test-integration\n"
"just qa test-integration -- tests/integration/memory/foo.test.ts\n"
"just test              # unit + integration（串行）\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:97
msgid "pre-commit `just qa test-changed` does **not** run integration tests."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:107
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Symptom                                             | Check                                                                                                                                                                   |\n"
"| --------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Service fails on DB connect                         | `database.url`; PostgreSQL running; `env()` refs resolvable if used; startup error message lists next steps (missing DB, auth, connection, extensions)                  |\n"
"| `Idle timeout reached after 30s` on startup/migrate | Bun ≤1.3.14 会误杀进行中查询（[oven-sh/bun#30646](https://github.com/oven-sh/bun/issues/30646)）。确保 `FREEANIMA_PG_POOL_IDLE_TIMEOUT=0`（默认）或临时导出该变量后重启 |\n"
"| Habitat 「未就绪」超时而进程仍在跑                  | 迁移在 HTTP listen **之前**；默认等 15min（`FREEANIMA_HABITAT_READY_TIMEOUT_MS`）。看 `journalctl --user -u anima -f`，勿中途 `stop`                                    |\n"
"| Migration fails                                     | Extensions installed; DB user has DDL privileges；HNSW / 大批量 backfill 可能很慢，勿与上述 idle timeout 混淆                                                           |\n"
"| FTS / keyword recall empty                          | `ensure-pg-extensions.sql` applied (`pg_trgm`); jieba/FTS rebuild if needed                                                                                             |\n"
msgstr ""

